Description: Fix C++23 incomplete type errors in V8 heap classes
 C++23 requires complete type definition before use in std::unique_ptr.
 Move MinorMarkingState class from concurrent-marking.cc to the header.
 Move WorkstackItemBase class inside CppGraphBuilderImpl before member use.
Author: Juan Manuel Mendez Rey <vejeta@gmail.com>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
